  "title": "The Sapphire Sojourner",
  "date": "2023-06-16",
  "excerpt": "Olympus Build Tier",
  "body": [
    "Meet the quintessential blue van, an emblem of timeless design and functionality. Its kitchen is well-equipped with a spacious Isotherm fridge—ideal for all your food and drink storage needs—a double burner induction stove top, and a full sink.",
    "Underneath the bed, there's handy access to the  garage' space   perfect for a canine companion's spot or for extra storage. The powerful 400W solar system and a hefty 400Ah of lithium batteries keep the 12v Dometic RTX 2000 AC unit and the Espar cabin heater humming along.",
    "In short, this van is a sleek and stylish home-on-wheels that's ready to accompany you on your grandest adventures."
